(text "J33 is a full40 physical-pin copy of J5:1->1 through40->40; HAT can be removed for expansion." (at 12.7 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 07c56f18-b256-5739-bed1-ae92bd74dab0))
(text "HAT power now follows ZERO HOST5; no AON5 or S3 I2C connection at J33." (at 12.7 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 049f09cb-405f-5564-9b2d-5a48141b2dfb))
(text "HAT SDA/SCL use ZERO3/5. ZERO3 published pin table lists GPIO/UART3 there; hardware-I2C support is not assumed." (at 12.7 262 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 4ecb3099-9261-59d0-a170-ea994eb8d130))
(text "A GPIO I2C software configuration on3/5 must be qualified. EYES moved to UART5_M1 physical32TX/33RX." (at 12.7 266 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid c92dab0d-6934-5861-b2ab-fa19fb3c2b5d))
(text "Fullcopy exposes already-used pins too: EYES32/33, LiDAR16/18 and debug8/10. Physical26 is NC on ZERO." (at 12.7 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 1d40ed99-5fc2-5d04-b926-e6f9b147a559))
(text "HAT VIN unused; onboard3V3 not paralleled with ZERO3V3. Servo current and shared HOST power path still require qualification." (at 12.7 274 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 1ce54fe7-411a-5b64-bb4a-3672f14544ea))
